es":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"YwezxSSXcrT5GOTI5MddPg","review_id":"V4cU5GxnNosMLEKmgOFe6g","date":"2011-10-06T17:36:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9431626796722412,"text_excerpt":"Hands down my favorite place to get oysters, and without a doubt one of my favorite restaurants anywhere. If you are looking for raw or fried oysters, COME HERE. Awesome small New Orleans restaurant feel, with oh, so good fried seafood. Start out with some raw oysters with your own self made cocktail sauce. Then get some fried crab claws and/or fried calamari. Not many places still have fried crab claws. I feel like I saw them a lot more than I was younger, but what could be better than fried crab claw meat? And then, one of my favorite things ever....The Oyster Loaf....fried oysters on thick cut white Bunny Bread. It honestly doesn't get better than this. I can not stress enough that if ..."},{"business_id":"YwezxSSXcrT5GOTI5MddPg","review_id":"W9pcoFfn2bOCoykJs7sBdQ","date":"2021-10-12T17:06:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.942438006401062,"text_excerpt":"This place is only open during oyster season so don't sleep on it. Get there while you can. I've heard about this place for years and finally made it over there. The dining room is fairly small, but there was only maybe a 2 minute wait to get a table at the time. For this visit went basic. It was more of an afternoon snack then a full lunch as I had eaten not long before. Started off with an oyster shooter, which seemed to be a new addition. It was delicious a single raw oyster, cocktail sauce, and I think some other spices in a shot glass and you just knock it back. Main thing I wanted to try was their charbroiled oysters and man they did not let me down. The cheese and everything they c..."},{"business_id":"YwezxSSXcrT5GOTI5MddPg","review_id":"csUWciXg7JLTteblPou7eQ","date":"2011-11-14T16:13:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9422416687011719,"text_excerpt":"Casamento's served me my first bite of food in New Orleans when I moved here 3 years ago. And it was my first bite of meat in a year (I was a strict vegetarian). And it was thrown into my mouth from 12 feet away. While waiting at the bar for a table, the oyster man shucked one in front of me and then, with the whole restaurant clapping and cheering my name, launched the erster perfectly into my mouth. This place is excellent. I'd say go for a dozen or two fresh, and the fried oyster sandwich. Such a classic, clean little joint."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"YwezxSSXcrT5GOTI5MddPg","photo_id":"snL99I01Qjqg5DQlsHbDHQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/snL99I01Qjqg5DQlsHbDHQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8755377531051636},{"business_id":"YwezxSSXcrT5GOTI5MddPg","photo_id":"GeLN4ug4N44M9eniqRLlyg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/GeLN4ug4N44M9eniqRLlyg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8529348373413086},{"business_id":"YwezxSSXcrT5GOTI5MddPg","photo_id":"90uffjSpgVyfCnBRTT0hYw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/90uffjSpgVyfCnBRTT0hYw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8313966989517212},{"business_id":"YwezxSSXcrT5GOTI5MddPg","photo_id":"yyfw1vRgBM3D8MfEn3baYA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/yyfw1vRgBM3D8MfEn3baYA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7871251106262207},{"business_id":"YwezxSSXcrT5GOTI5MddPg","photo_id":"mEh5L71tygaVyEjRlvhyZA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/mEh5L71tygaVyEjRlvhyZA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.630734920501709}]},"notebook_case":null}
